.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/franco-nevada-corp-fnv-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q1","e":"fnv","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sandip Rana","x":"With the additional GEOs to be received in 2021, we have increased our guidance to 580,000 to 615,000 for the year from the previous 555,000 to 585,000.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/franco-nevada-corp-fnv-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q2","e":"fnv","d":"2021-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sandip Rana","x":"Franco-Nevada is both a royalty and a streaming company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/12/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q2","e":"fnv","d":"2021-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Brink","x":"We operate with small headcount and low G&A. Commodity price increases flow directly to our bottom line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/12/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q2","e":"fnv","d":"2021-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandip Rana","x":"With respect to margins, the chart on Slide 7 illustrates how the margin for the company increases as the gold price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/12/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q3","e":"fnv","d":"2021-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Paul Brink","x":"I believe the only time we've had higher margins was before we started streaming, which was right after our IPO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q3","e":"fnv","d":"2021-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sandip Rana","x":"Franco-Nevada is both a royalty and a streaming company. slide six breaks down the mix between streams and royalty revenue for third quarter 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q3","e":"fnv","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandip Rana","x":"With respect to margins, the chart on slide seven illustrates how the margin for the company increases as the gold price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q3","e":"fnv","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Brink","x":"I think for our increased guidance, it's -- the increase in the guidance is primarily driven by higher prices at this stage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2021 Q3","e":"fnv","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tyler Langton","x":"In terms of the increased guidance and sort of improved results, is that more just sort of the benefit of higher prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/franco-nevada-corporation-fnv-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FNV 2025 Q4","e":"fnv","d":"2026-03-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Paul Brink","x":"What I'm very excited about is given the deal that we've done in Australia, the deal that BHP did, I think the streaming market is very much in consideration by CFOs in the mining industry at the moment, and that should drive further activity going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/11/franco-nevada-fnv-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FNV 2026 Q1","e":"fnv","d":"2026-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Paul Brink","x":"Not only is our royalty and streaming model largely insulated from the effect of energy prices and cost inflation, but at current prices, oil and liquids can contribute meaningfully to our revenue mix.","url":"https://w